{
  "uid": "api-health",
  "title": "Plataforma - Saúde das APIs",
  "description": "Health check das APIs do workspace (/health/live e /health/ready de cadastro e legado), medido pelo blackbox exporter e lido do Prometheus: estado UP/DOWN, latência e disponibilidade em 24 h, 7 d e 30 d. Só métricas de sonda (sem dados de negócio ou pessoais).",
  "tags": [
    "plataforma",
    "prometheus",
    "health"
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Estado dos health checks",
      "description": "UP = a sonda recebeu HTTP 2xx. DOWN = falhou (API fora do ar, dependência obrigatória indisponível no ready, ou nome do alvo não resolve: veja o cartão abaixo). live = processo responde; ready = dependências obrigatórias ok.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "probe_success{job=\"api-health\",project!=\"smoke\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{project}} / {{endpoint}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Sem dados",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "Sem dados",
                  "color": "orange"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Nome do alvo resolve?",
      "description": "Distingue falha de DNS de API fora do ar. \"Não resolve\" = o nome do container não existe na rede (projeto Compose, escala ou nome diferente): ajuste prometheus/targets/apis.yml. \"Resolve\" com DOWN acima = a API realmente não respondeu.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "clamp_max(probe_ip_addr_hash{job=\"api-health\",project!=\"smoke\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "{{project}} / {{endpoint}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Sem dados",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Não resolve",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Resolve",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "Sem dados",
                  "color": "orange"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência da sonda",
      "description": "Tempo total da sonda HTTP até cada endpoint de saúde (medido pelo blackbox exporter a cada 15 s).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (project, endpoint) (probe_duration_seconds{job=\"api-health\",project!=\"smoke\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{project}} / {{endpoint}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Sem dados",
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disponibilidade 24 h",
      "description": "Fração de sondas com sucesso nas últimas 24 horas, por endpoint (regra gravada project_endpoint:probe_success:avg_over_time24h). Verde a partir de 99,9%; amarelo a partir de 99%.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "project_endpoint:probe_success:avg_over_time24h{project!=\"smoke\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{project}} / {{endpoint}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Sem dados",
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.99
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.999
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
